WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:08.320
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:14.830
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.660
It's my day!

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:27.240
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:34.650
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:42.020
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:49.430
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:55.200
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:02.340
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:09.850
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:15.990
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:19.050
I just want to walk

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:22.590
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.560
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:35.470
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:41.910
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:44.180
It's my day!

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:55.890
Rui!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.360
I missed you so much!

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:23.280
"The Ordinary Duo!"

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:35.930
<i>Large eyes...</i>

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.430
<i>And flowing chestnut brown hair.</i>

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:41.900
<i>I've never seen such
a beautiful woman.</i>

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:47.670
Rui, let me look at you.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:52.980
You've grown into such
a handsome man.

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:57.620
I've... I've missed you so much.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:00.890
I missed you, too.

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:02.450
Shizuka!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.660
Tsukasa! Akira! Sojiro!

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:08.390
Welcome home, Shizuka!

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.390
Nice to be back.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.430
Shizuka, you're even
more beautiful now.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.500
Thanks.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:24.440
<i>Who kisses just to say hello?!</i>

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.210
When'd you get back?

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:28.480
We saw your poster. Looks great.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.380
Tell us all about France.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.920
All right then! Let's go out
for a celebration.

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:40.990
Rui, what're you doing?
Let's go.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.900
<i>I thought women like that</i>

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:54.870
<i>existed only in novels
or the movies.</i>

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.940
<i>S-she's way out of my league...</i>

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.240
<i>I don't have a chance.</i>

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.820
When I was young...

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:15.020
I was so poor, I had to make
one pickled plum last three days.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:17.960
What's the matter, Tsukushi?

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.200
N-nothing.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.030
Then I was hospitalized for anemia!

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:28.570
I'm done.

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:31.710
No, Susumu! Sit down and
finish it up!

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:34.910
One fish cost 250 yen!

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:37.980
Aww... no thanks. I'm full.

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:42.120
By the way, can't you raise my
allowance a little bit?

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.320
20,000 yen a month is
just too...

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.260
Sure, when you become manager.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.860
You're mean... too mean!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:52.730
Then starting tomorrow, your lunch
will be pickled plum!

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:53.830
Is that okay?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.360
N... no!

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.030
<i>Being born into a family like this...</i>

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.570
<i>No wonder I don't have a chance.</i>

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.870
<i>I guess... average people like us...</i>

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.280
<i>Live in a different worid.</i>

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.190
<i>It was a mistake...</i>

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.990
<i>that I entered the small,
elite world of Eitoku Academy.</i>

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.360
<i>I'm not in love.</i>

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:39.810
<i>I'd better forget it...
before I get serious.</i>

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:44.210
<i>Before I feel even
more miserable.</i>

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:48.680
<i>I'll stay away from the F4 and
return to my old self.</i>

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:53.220
Bye-bye...

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:56.820
Rui Hanazawa.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:03.730
As always, you know all
the strangest places.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.630
No sense in taking you to a
French restaurant, right?

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:10.700
You call people like us
childish friends.

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:13.370
Stupid, you mean "childhood" friends!

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.080
You haven't changed at all, Tsukasa.

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.710
Is your sister well?

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:23.220
She got married last year and
lives in Beverly Hills with her husband.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:27.720
You must be lonely.
You were so close to your sister.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.960
But now, there's a wild girl
who's taken her place.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.990
Her name's Tsukushi Makino.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.090
S-shut up!

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:38.830
As if I'd give that pauper girl
the time of day!

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:46.570
Rui, why so glum?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.540
Shizuka is back!

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:52.240
I know that.
She's sitting right here.

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:56.410
He always gets moody when
he's happy.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:58.520
That's right.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:00.990
That's not it!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.360
Rui, what's the matter?
Don't you feel well?

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:12.400
Why'd you let them...
take pictures like that?

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:15.630
You're practically naked!

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.680
What a guy!

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:29.010
It's better for my career...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.280
if I'm recognized by people.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.520
Well, I still don't like it.

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.520
You're different from
those brainless models, Shizuka.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.290
Sorry... I'm acting like a kid.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.730
You're very kind, Rui.

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:52.070
Always thinking about me...

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.470
I love you so much.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.410
<i>I love you so much, Rui...</i>

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:06.080
<i>And I love Tsukasa and Sojiro
and Akira, too.</i>

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:35.310
<i>I wasn't even thinking!</i>

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:40.850
<i>With only 3,000 yen each
month in allowance,</i>

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.980
<i>I can't even go to the beauty salon.</i>

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.920
<i>Having braids is so economical...</i>

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:49.260
What's with that hair?

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:52.090
Perfect style for a pauper.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.090
<i>Him again.</i>

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:57.430
Finally decided to defer
to the F4?

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.170
At least you know your
place now.

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:03.370
<i>Know my place?!</i>

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:05.970
Huh?! Why're you glaring at me?

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.940
Want to go at it? Want to?

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:18.620
<i>I'm so mad, but I can't
snap back at him!</i>

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:26.460
<i>Bye-bye... Rui Hanazawa.</i>

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:31.630
<i>That's right. I made up my mind
to stay away from the F4.</i>

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.530
<i>But what's this emptiness I'm feeling?</i>

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:35.570
Tsukushi?

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.110
It <i>is</i> Tsukushi!

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:51.850
It's me! Remember?

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:55.350
We were in the same class 
in elementary school. Kazuya Aoike.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:04.760
Huh? Kazuya?!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.060
You remember?

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:08.530
Why're you here?

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:10.370
I transferred.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:11.840
Remember? My family were farmers.

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:14.410
Just before the economic bubble
burst, we sold the land.

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:16.540
And we became nouveau riche.

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:18.540
And now that the interest
rates are low,

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:20.480
we built a house in Setagaya.

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:23.450
Really! How nostalgic!

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:25.950
To meet in a place like this!

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:29.390
I was nervous about coming to
a prestigious school like Eitoku.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:33.220
But a friend from elementary school
mentioned that you attended

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:34.490
and I was so relieved.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.100
<i>That's right. I've been branded.</i>

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:45.800
Um... Kazuya... maybe it's better
if you don't talk to me too much.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:48.140
Huh? Why?

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:50.540
You're the only one
I can rely on!

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:54.380
When we were kids,
you always looked after me!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.010
Oh, all right. Okay.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.350
<i>I'm such a sucker when they
say things like that.</i>

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:05.190
Why aren't they
dressed in uniform?

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:17.500
Listen up!

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:19.630
If you want to be happy
at this school,

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.700
stay away from those kids.

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:23.310
W-why?

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:25.070
Because!

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.910
<i>Nothing is more frightening
than ignorance.</i>

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.610
But isn't it nostalgic?

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.220
Remember how we always climbed
the mountain for yomogi herbs?

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:39.420
And Granny would make
us yomogi dumplings.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.820
Uh-huh, uh-huh!

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:44.330
And dessert would be
30-yen popsicles!

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.230
Yeah, yeah!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:49.460
And if your stick had a mark,
you got another one for free!

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:52.230
Tsukushi Makino's with a guy!

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:54.740
Never seen him before... what a dweeb.

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.970
A pair of no-classers?

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:59.010
Say, do you know this?

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:02.280
Oh, it was the rage at
my other school!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:04.850
It's fun, isn't it?

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:05.980
<i>This is it!</i>

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.320
<i>This enthusiasm is
what's missing at Eitoku.</i>

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:09.620
<i>I'm so glad!</i>

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.340
Kazuya...

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.480
Are you ready? Let's go home.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:13.880
Just a sec.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.680
Huh? There's something in here.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.680
What's this?

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.030
<i>A red slip!</i>

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:31.860
<i>Why Kazuya?!</i>

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:41.840
Does this red paper mean,
"Welcome, transfer student"?

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:44.210
- No!
- Is he serious?

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.740
Kids at Eitoku are nice.

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:48.110
Right?

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.350
They're all so shy.

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.020
<i>Domyoji... what're you up to?</i>

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:05.930
Hey! What're you doing?!

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:08.030
Run!

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:19.810
Huh?! Fermented beans!

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.010
Get outta here, stupid!

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:25.210
You're mean!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:27.780
Hurry and run!

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:34.660
Tsukushi...

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:36.790
Stop it, you guys!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.230
Next is this!

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:40.530
Take that!

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:42.600
Get them!

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.800
Tsukushi! Are you all right?

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:47.770
I'm fine. I'm used to this.

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:56.210
<i>That jerk! I won't let him
get away with this!</i>

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.380
Tsukushi!

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:08.190
I never thought of you
as a decent human being!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:10.390
But I see that you're no
better than vermin!

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:14.190
Just what do you think
you're doing, you jerk?

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.170
How dare you hurt
my dear friend!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.930
Say something!

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:22.340
It's because...

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.400
Because you don't understand a thing!

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:28.010
It's all your fault!

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.310
Hope you learned your lesson, stupid!

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:42.320
Why?

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.420
Why is it my fault?

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:49.230
Why must I be insulted by
a brainless idiot like you?

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:51.330
B-brainless?

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:56.240
Then... then you're saying that guy
has more brains?

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:58.240
Kazuya?

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:01.870
Yeah... that nerdy,
got-rich-quick kid.

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:03.710
You're an eyesore...

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:06.410
Two paupers acting so chummy.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:11.920
"Dear" friend? Gives me a
chill down my spine!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:15.020
He is my DEAR friend!
He's my oasis!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:17.390
The flower that blossomed
in the desert!

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:20.660
What do you see in
an average guy like that?

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:22.060
You like him?

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:24.160
Yes, I do! I loooove him!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.900
He's a hundred times,
a thousand times better than you!

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:40.880
How dare you slap a girl!

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:44.720
W-wait! I didn't mean that.
I'll explain...

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.520
Why you...

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.450
Disgusting jerk!

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:57.760
I'll never forgive you!

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.600
<i>Oh no! Kazuya!</i>

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.470
Get this off! It smells!

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:09.740
Kazuya!

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:12.110
What're you doing?!

00:17:12.310 --> 00:17:14.080
Kazuya, are you all right?

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:15.350
I'll get it off right away.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.050
I don't like this...

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:22.120
Tsukushi... what's going on?!

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:23.550
Found them!

00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:25.390
Talk later!

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:26.420
Just run!

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:34.330
I think we gave them the slip.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.470
I'm so sorry, Kazuya.

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:40.940
On the day you transferred, too...

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:43.370
Why are you apologizing?

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:45.770
I'm not really sure...

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.980
But I think I'm to blame
for this.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:54.350
Kazuya, it's not too late.
Change schools.

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:57.850
Then what about you?

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:02.160
I'll be all right.
It's just for two more years.

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:06.760
I'll hang in there.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.960
If I'm with you, I can take it.

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:11.900
I can't leave you alone in
a place like this.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:13.900
Kazuya!

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:17.240
Oh, how touching!
Such beautiful friendship.

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:19.240
It suits you, Tsukushi...

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:22.280
Trash perfume is perfect on you!

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:24.140
<i>Asai and her friends...</i>

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:27.580
Domyoji saved you on a whim.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:30.550
But you got cocky, and
this is what happens.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.650
Everyone, over here!

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.890
The red-slip couple is
right here!

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.260
What?

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.830
What're you doing?
Hurry and run away.

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:46.270
I'll return the favor one day!

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:49.700
Hey! They're running
towards the college!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:55.310
Hey! Wait!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:59.450
Miss Aoi!

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:02.420
If you're going to sleep,
come to the infirmary.

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.520
"Summer school in Hawaii"?

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:14.390
"Nurture kind hearts in
a setting of natural beauty," huh?

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.970
So much commotion
on the high school side.

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:26.470
He went and posted 
another red slip

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:27.940
without our permission.

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:31.240
So what?
They seemed bored anyway.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:33.680
We're the instigators
of the game.

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.850
Gotta let them have fun sometimes.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.720
Up to your bad old tricks, as usual.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:40.390
Never mind that, Shizuka.

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.490
Meet any cool guys in Paris?

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:44.990
Huh? What's this all of a sudden?

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:48.590
Well, bet they wouldn't leave a
pretty girl like you alone.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:51.400
Well...

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:56.430
<i>Femme fatale</i>... Some called me
their woman of destiny.

00:19:56.970 --> 00:20:01.470
But unless I felt the same way,
it was over before it even started.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:03.310
Hmm... like that, is it?

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:04.840
If it were me...

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.340
That's why we call you an animal.

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:10.010
- Hey! Stop!
- Stop!

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:15.050
<i>Oh no... so many college students!</i>

00:20:15.390 --> 00:20:16.550
Ugh! Who are they?

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:18.020
Are they from the high school?

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:19.420
They smell awful!

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:22.590
You got some nerve
running in here!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.530
Sorry! Ladies and gents...

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:30.770
Please don't pay any
attention to us.

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:34.240
Hey, come with us you filthy germs!

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:36.070
What're they doing?

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:39.310
Is this what they do
in Japan these days, Rui?

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.290
<i>Someone...</i>

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:00.600
<i>Please help us...</i>

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:19.980
Quit acting like kids!

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:24.620
<i>Rui Hanazawa!</i>

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:51.410
<i>Rui Hanazawa saved me...</i>

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:53.410
<i>I can't believe it!</i>

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:11.260
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.230 --> 00:22:19.140
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:29.010
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:37.060
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:44.830
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:52.970
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:52.970
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:52.970 --> 00:23:01.350
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:52.970 --> 00:23:01.350
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:11.120
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:18.900
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:27.070
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:27.070
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:35.480
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:35.480
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.230
<i>Rui Hanazawa sacrificed himself
to save me.</i>

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:52.330
<i>And Domyoji breaks off
his friendship with him.</i>

00:23:52.600 --> 00:23:57.100
<i>So why is he at my house
eating stewed taro?</i>

00:23:57.430 --> 00:23:59.240
<i>I don't know what's going on anymore!</i>

00:23:59.670 --> 00:24:02.300
<i>Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"Me, Him, and the Other Guy!"</i>

00:24:02.970 --> 00:24:08.180
<i>Rui Hanazawa... you really are
the man I thought you were.</i>
